# Checkpoints, caches, logs and the fp16 PCM memmaps. Training output, not
# source -- a single cache file is several GB.
#
# `runs/*` and not `runs/`: git never descends into an ignored DIRECTORY, so a
# negation under `runs/` can never be reached. That one character is the
# difference between the launcher below being tracked and being invisible.
runs/*
# ...except the launcher that drives a run. It lives in runs/ because every
# path it names is under runs/.
!runs/pipeline-full.ps1
!runs/pipeline-v2.ps1
